<p><strong>Change order <%= @change_order.label %></strong> from <%= @company.name %>, to home order <%= @po.po_number %></p>
<% if @message.present? %><p><%= simple_format(@message) %></p><% end %>
<p>The change order is attached (<%= @change_order.label %>.pdf): <%= @change_order.lines.size %> line change(s)<% if @change_order.colors.any? %> and <%= @change_order.colors.size %> color or finish change(s)<% end %><% unless @po.hide_prices_for_factory? %>, cost difference <%= number_to_currency(@change_order.cost_delta) %><% end %>.</p>
<p><strong>Production status:</strong> <%= @change_order.production_warning %></p>
<p>Please confirm the change by replying to this email, or tell us what it costs or why it cannot be made.</p>
<p><% if @sender %><%= @sender.try(:name) %><br><% end %><%= @company.name %></p>
